{"seq":2,"slug":"viz-tools-ecosystem","title":"可视化工具生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/viz-tools-ecosystem","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可视化工具生态\">可视化工具生态</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据可视化工具生态是一个从底层图形引擎到高层业务图表库的多层体系。不同层次的工具在抽象程度、定制能力和开发效率之间做出不同的权衡，开发者需要根据项目需求、团队能力和交付时间选择合适的工具组合。</p>\n<p>可视化工具可以按照抽象层次分为四层，每一层在下一层基础上封装更多默认行为，同时牺牲部分底层控制能力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>范畴</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图形引擎层</td>\n<td>Canvas / SVG / WebGL 原生 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化语法层</td>\n<td>D3、Vega</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图表组件层</td>\n<td>ECharts、Chart.js、Recharts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析平台层</td>\n<td>Tableau、Metabase、Superset</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[分析平台层] --&gt; B[图表组件层]&#10;    B --&gt; C[可视化语法层]&#10;    C --&gt; D[图形引擎层]&#10;    A --&gt; A1[Tableau / Metabase / Superset]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[ECharts / Chart.js / Recharts]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[D3.js / Vega / Observable Plot]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[Canvas / SVG / WebGL]\">graph TD\n    A[分析平台层] --&gt; B[图表组件层]\n    B --&gt; C[可视化语法层]\n    C --&gt; D[图形引擎层]\n    A --&gt; A1[Tableau / Metabase / Superset]\n    B --&gt; B1[ECharts / Chart.js / Recharts]\n    C --&gt; C1[D3.js / Vega / Observable Plot]\n    D --&gt; D1[Canvas / SVG / WebGL]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具层次</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n<th>抽象程度</th>\n<th>定制能力</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图形引擎</td>\n<td>Canvas, SVG, WebGL</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>陡峭</td>\n<td>自定义渲染引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可视化语法</td>\n<td>D3, Vega, G2</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>创意可视化、叙事项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图表组件</td>\n<td>ECharts, Chart.js</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>平缓</td>\n<td>业务仪表盘、报表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析平台</td>\n<td>Tableau, Superset</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>非技术用户分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声明式图表库\">声明式图表库</h2><p>声明式图表库是当前最主流的可视化开发方式，开发者通过配置对象描述&quot;要什么图表&quot;，库自动处理渲染细节。这类库以 ECharts、Chart.js 和 Highcharts 为代表，它们提供了丰富的内置图表类型和交互功能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"echarts\">ECharts</h3><p>ECharts 是百度开源的可视化库，以配置驱动著称。它的 option 对象是一个完整的图表描述，包含数据、样式、交互和动画的所有配置。ECharts 支持 Canvas 和 SVG 双渲染引擎，内置了从基础柱状图到复杂地理热力图的 20+ 种图表类型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface EChartsOption {&#10;  title: { text: string; subtext?: string };&#10;  tooltip: { trigger: &#39;axis&#39; | &#39;item&#39; };&#10;  xAxis: { type: &#39;category&#39;; data: string[] };&#10;  yAxis: { type: &#39;value&#39; };&#10;  series: Array&lt;{&#10;    name: string;&#10;    type: &#39;bar&#39; | &#39;line&#39; | &#39;scatter&#39; | &#39;pie&#39;;&#10;    data: number[];&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createSalesChart(container: HTMLElement): void {&#10;  const chart = echarts.init(container);&#10;  const option: EChartsOption = {&#10;    title: { text: &#39;月度销售趋势&#39; },&#10;    tooltip: { trigger: &#39;axis&#39; },&#10;    xAxis: {&#10;      type: &#39;category&#39;,&#10;      data: [&#39;1月&#39;, &#39;2月&#39;, &#39;3月&#39;, &#39;4月&#39;, &#39;5月&#39;, &#39;6月&#39;],&#10;    },&#10;    yAxis: { type: &#39;value&#39; },&#10;    series: [&#10;      { name: &#39;2023&#39;, type: &#39;bar&#39;, data: [120, 200, 150, 80, 70, 110] },&#10;      { name: &#39;2024&#39;, type: &#39;line&#39;, data: [150, 230, 180, 120, 100, 140] },&#10;    ],&#10;  };&#10;  chart.setOption(option);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EChartsOption</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">subtext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tooltip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'axis'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  xAxis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'category'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  yAxis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  series</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bar'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'line'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'scatter'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pie'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createSalesChart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> chart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> echarts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(container);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> option</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EChartsOption</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    title: { text: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'月度销售趋势'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tooltip: { trigger: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'axis'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    xAxis: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'category'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      data: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'6月'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    yAxis: { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'value'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    series: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2023'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bar'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">110</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'line'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">230</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">140</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  chart.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setOption</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(option);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"chart-js\">Chart.js</h3><p>Chart.js 以轻量和易用著称，压缩后仅约 70KB，适合不需要复杂定制的快速可视化需求。它基于 Canvas 渲染，内置 8 种图表类型，通过插件机制扩展功能。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>ECharts</th>\n<th>Chart.js</th>\n<th>Highcharts</th>\n<th>Recharts</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体积（gzip）</td>\n<td>~300KB</td>\n<td>~70KB</td>\n<td>~200KB</td>\n<td>~50KB（不含 D3）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染引擎</td>\n<td>Canvas + SVG</td>\n<td>Canvas</td>\n<td>SVG</td>\n<td>SVG（D3）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图表类型数</td>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>20+</td>\n<td>10+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 集成</td>\n<td>第三方封装</td>\n<td>react-chartjs-2</td>\n<td>第三方封装</td>\n<td>原生 React</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源协议</td>\n<td>Apache 2.0</td>\n<td>MIT</td>\n<td>商业 + CC</td>\n<td>MIT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大数据优化</td>\n<td>内置增量渲染</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>需自行优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地图支持</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"react-可视化生态\">React 可视化生态</h2><p>在 React 生态中，可视化工具面临一个独特挑战：如何将数据驱动的可视化范式与 React 的组件化声明式 UI 模型融合。不同的库采用了不同的策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"recharts\">Recharts</h3><p>Recharts 是基于 D3 和 React 构建的声明式图表库，将每个图表元素（坐标轴、图例、数据系列）都封装为 React 组件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { LineChart, Line, XAxis, YAxis, CartesianGrid, Tooltip, Legend, ResponsiveContainer } from &#39;recharts&#39;&#10;&#10;interface ChartData {&#10;  month: string&#10;  revenue: number&#10;  cost: number&#10;}&#10;&#10;const SalesChart: React.FC&lt;{ data: ChartData[] }&gt; = ({ data }) =&gt; (&#10;  &lt;ResponsiveContainer width=&quot;100%&quot; height={400}&gt;&#10;    &lt;LineChart data={data}&gt;&#10;      &lt;CartesianGrid strokeDasharray=&quot;3 3&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;XAxis dataKey=&quot;month&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;YAxis /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Tooltip /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Legend /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Line type=&quot;monotone&quot; dataKey=&quot;revenue&quot; stroke=&quot;#8884d8&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Line type=&quot;monotone&quot; dataKey=&quot;cost&quot; stroke=&quot;#82ca9d&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/LineChart&gt;&#10;  &lt;/ResponsiveContainer&gt;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { LineChart, Line, XAxis, YAxis, CartesianGrid, Tooltip, Legend, ResponsiveContainer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'recharts'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChartData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  month</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  revenue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SalesChart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> React</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChartData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] }> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ResponsiveContainer width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"100%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LineChart data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{data}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CartesianGrid strokeDasharray</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3 3\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">XAxis dataKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"month\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">YAxis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Tooltip </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Legend </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Line type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monotone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"revenue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stroke</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#8884d8\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Line type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monotone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stroke</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#82ca9d\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LineChart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ResponsiveContainer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"visx-与-nivo\">Visx 与 Nivo</h3><ul>\n<li>Visx（原 vx）：Airbnb 开源的低级可视化组件库，将 D3 的各模块（比例尺、形状、轴）封装为独立 React 组件，像搭积木一样组合可视化，适合高度定制场景</li>\n<li>Nivo：提供丰富的预设图表类型和主题系统，同时支持 SVG 和 Canvas 渲染，在 Recharts 的易用性和 Visx 的灵活性之间取得平衡</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可视化语法与-vega\">可视化语法与 Vega</h2><p>可视化语法（Grammar of Graphics）是一种描述可视化的形式化语言，它将图表分解为正交的组件，Vega 和 Vega-Lite 是这一理念的 JSON 实现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据 Data</td>\n<td>内联或外部数据源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换 Transform</td>\n<td>过滤、聚合、计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标记 Mark</td>\n<td>点、线、面、文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码 Encoding</td>\n<td>位置、颜色、大小、形状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互 Selection</td>\n<td>点选、框选、缩放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"vega-lite\">Vega-Lite</h3><p>Vega-Lite 的核心思想是用简洁的 JSON 描述定义数据到视觉通道的映射，系统自动推断图表类型、比例尺范围、轴标签等细节。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VegaLiteSpec {&#10;  $schema: string;&#10;  data: { values: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[] };&#10;  mark: &#39;bar&#39; | &#39;line&#39; | &#39;point&#39; | &#39;area&#39; | &#39;circle&#39;;&#10;  encoding: {&#10;    x: { field: string; type: &#39;quantitative&#39; | &#39;nominal&#39; | &#39;temporal&#39; | &#39;ordinal&#39; };&#10;    y: { field: string; type: &#39;quantitative&#39; | &#39;nominal&#39; | &#39;temporal&#39; | &#39;ordinal&#39; };&#10;    color?: { field: string; type: string };&#10;    size?: { field: string; type: string };&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const scatterSpec: VegaLiteSpec = {&#10;  $schema: &#39;https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json&#39;,&#10;  data: {&#10;    values: [&#10;      { x: 1, y: 2, category: &#39;A&#39; },&#10;      { x: 3, y: 5, category: &#39;B&#39; },&#10;      { x: 5, y: 3, category: &#39;A&#39; },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;  mark: &#39;point&#39;,&#10;  encoding: {&#10;    x: { field: &#39;x&#39;, type: &#39;quantitative&#39; },&#10;    y: { field: &#39;y&#39;, type: &#39;quantitative&#39; },&#10;    color: { field: &#39;category&#39;, type: &#39;nominal&#39; },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VegaLiteSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  $schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>[] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  mark</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bar'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'line'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'point'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'area'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'circle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  encoding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><spa